        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 82.9" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="599" ed="#liebermann"/>Peccunialis<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="26" target="#Hn_82-9.lnote.oe.26"/> autem emendacio legibus inuenta est, si desponsata femina fornicetur, et cyrlisca<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="27" target="#Hn_82-9.lnote.oe.27"/> uel syxhinda<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="g" target="#Hn_82-9.lnote.oe.g"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="28" target="#Hn_82-9.lnote.oe.28"/> uel tƿelfhinda sit; et corporalis diffactio<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="29" target="#Hn_82-9.lnote.oe.29"/> persistentibus instituta.</ab>
